Package: NorMacro
Title: Norwegian Macroeconomic Data and Analysis Tools
Version: 2.0.3
Authors@R:
    person(
        given = "Nils",
        family = "Kvilvang",
        email = "nils@kvilvang.no",
        role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
Description: Provides reproducible access to curated Norwegian macroeconomic
    time series, international indicators, and selected KOSTRA data from public
    sources. Includes standardized metadata and tools for exploration,
    visualization, comparison, transformation, correlation, regression, and
    other time-series analyses.
